+
+| | Wall time | Answer recall | Citation recall | Claim precision | Post-utterance p95 |
 |---|---|---|---|---|---|
-| **Streaming** | 74.5% | 86.7% | 87.7% | 50% | **< 16 ms / < 16 ms** |
