+
+**Generative synthesis** (`synthesis.mode="generative"`, `streaming_rag/session/generative/`): an
+LLM writes each claim, which is then verified against the retrieved evidence before it ships;
+late-arriving constraints are applied by keep/amend/retract rather than re-writing from scratch. It is
+structurally tested (version sequencing, session isolation, no disk writes, graceful degradation under
+a failing/slow LLM) with an offline double that copies source sentences — this proves the wiring is
+correct, not that its answers are good. **No LLM provider key was available in this environment**, so
+it carries **zero** gold-referenced measurements and is not used by any number in §5. Before relying on
+it: `python -m eval.run_quality --scenarios eval/scenarios_real_test --corpus-dir data/corpus_test
+--set synthesis.mode=generative` with a real provider key.
 
